-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party work used in mmemu
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SID emulation (src/plugins/devices/sid6581/) is based on models and measured
data from these projects, licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 2 or later (compatible with AGPL-3.0-or-later):

  reSID (Dag Lem)
    https://github.com/libsidplayfp/resid
    - per-cycle voice, envelope and filter structure (reSID 0.16)
    - envelope rate and exponential counter tables
    - measured 6581/8580 filter cutoff curves
    - 6581 DC offsets and the C64 external output filter
    - op-amp output ranges from the measured transfer curves (reSID 1.0)

  reSIDfp / libsidplayfp (Antti Lankila, Leandro Nini)
    https://github.com/libsidplayfp/libresidfp
    https://github.com/libsidplayfp/combined-waveforms
    - combined-waveform pulldown model and its fitted parameters
    - real-chip OSC3 samplings (from Trurl, ltx128, reFX-Mike; sampling
      program by Dag Lem), a small extract of which is used in a unit test

The GTIA palette (src/plugins/devices/gtia/) is generated from the palette
model of atari800 (https://atari800.github.io/), GPL-2.0-or-later.

